      "versionNonce": 1214745328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now \u2014 Phases 1\u20133\n\n\u2022 8\u201316 pods \u00d7 16 concurrency\n\u2022 eval_global 256 \u00b7 job 128\n\u2022 import 96 / workspace 48 (keep)\n\u2022 KEDA on org-wide pending rows\n\u2022 No PgBouncer\n\n~256 parallel rows at max scale\nDual 10k \u2248 32 min",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6laIcdoTDY",
      "originalText": "Now \u2014 Phases 1\u20133\n\n\u2022 8\u201316 pods \u00d7 16 concurrency\n\u2022 eval_global 256 \u00b7 job 128\n\u2022 import 96 / workspace 48 (keep)\n\u2022 KEDA on org-wide pending rows\n\u2022 No PgBouncer\n\n~256 parallel rows at max scale\nDual 10k \u2248 32 min",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
